{{!
    @template local_moodesk/new_ticket_drawer

    Right-anchored overlay panel hosting the ticket submission form on the list
    and dashboard screens.

    The panel is rendered on every page load and hidden with visibility (never
    display:none), so its controls initialise against a container that already
    has its final width — which the message box needs, since it sizes itself
    from what is written into it and an element with no layout has no height to
    grow from. The form inside is moodleform's
    own markup, rendered verbatim and restyled by components/_drawer.scss; its
    action points at submit.php, which stays the POST target and the no-JS
    fallback. The form's own action buttons are the drawer footer — the drawer
    never adds a second pair.

    Context variables:
      * title      - Drawer heading ("Submit a support ticket")
      * subtitle   - Supporting line under the heading
      * closelabel - Accessible label for the close button
      * unsavedconfirm - Prompt shown when closing with a ticket half written
      * form       - Raw moodleform HTML (rendered elsewhere)

    Example context (json):
    {
      "title": "Submit a support ticket",
      "subtitle": "Fill in the details below to create a new support request.",
      "closelabel": "Close",
      "unsavedconfirm": "You have an unsent message. Discard it and close?",
      "form": "<form class=\"mform\"></form>"
    }
}}
<div class="mhd-ticket-drawer-mount" data-region="mhd-ticket-drawer"
     data-unsaved-confirm="{{unsavedconfirm}}">
    <div class="mhd-ticket-drawer__backdrop" data-region="mhd-drawer-backdrop"></div>
    {{! A modal dialog, not complementary content: `aside` cannot carry
        role="dialog" or aria-modal and the validator rejects both. }}
    <div class="mhd-ticket-drawer"
         data-region="mhd-drawer-panel"
         role="dialog"
         aria-modal="true"
         aria-labelledby="mhd-ticket-drawer-title">
        <header class="mhd-ticket-drawer__header">
            <div class="mhd-ticket-drawer__heading">
                <h2 class="mhd-ticket-drawer__title" id="mhd-ticket-drawer-title">{{title}}</h2>
                <p class="mhd-ticket-drawer__subtitle">{{subtitle}}</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button"
                    class="mhd-ticket-drawer__close"
                    data-action="mhd-drawer-close"
                    aria-label="{{closelabel}}">
                <svg class="mhd-ticket-drawer__close-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <use href="#mhd-icon-close"></use>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </header>
        <div class="mhd-ticket-drawer__body" data-region="mhd-drawer-body">
            {{{form}}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
